ZATS Mimic 10.2.1-jakarta
* Features
  ZATS-79: Modernize ZATS for ZK 10 Jakarta and Jetty 12 compatibility (contributed by Michael Szediwy)
  + Upgraded to Jetty 12 (ee10) with full Jakarta EE 10 / Servlet 6.0 support
  + ZatsEnvironment.init() now automatically destroys any existing emulator before re-initializing,
    preventing cascading "already started up" failures across test suites
  + Multipart/file-upload support restored via MultipartConfigElement applied at Jetty startup
  + EmulatorBuilder refactored to use canonical paths for content roots (macOS/Jetty 12 compatibility)
  + URL encoding in AU requests simplified to use URLEncoder directly
  + Decimal and colorbox input agents fixed: use correct "rawValue" field name for ZK 10
  + MaximizeEvent/MinimizeEvent restored to use comp.getWidth()/getHeight()
  + JSON parser now leniently handles unrecognized escape sequences (e.g. \- from Java Encoder API),
    fixing download URL parsing when Filedownload.save() is called during doAfterCompose()
  + Download URL ;jsessionid= path parameter stripped before fetching, for Jetty 12 compatibility

* Bugs
  + Fixed: download triggered in doAfterCompose() fails with FileNotFoundException under Jetty 12
  + Fixed: re-init of ZatsEnvironment without prior destroy caused emulator startup failure
  + Fixed: EmulatorTest static resource serving broken on macOS with Jetty 12 (canonical path fix)
  + Fixed: special characters (space, +, %, &, Unicode) lost in AU request encode/decode round-trip

* Upgrade Notes
  + Requires ZK 10.2.1-jakarta (or compatible)
  + Requires JDK 11+
  + Upgraded Jetty from 11 to 12.0.10 (ee10); Jakarta EE 10 / Servlet 6.0 API required
  + commons-io harmonized to 2.16.1 across all modules (Multi-Release JAR support)

  Thanks to Michael Szediwy for contributing the Modernization for ZK 10 Jakarta and Jetty 12 support.
